			"Message": "refactor(Output): Reformat build configuration and expand webview diagnostics\n\nReformat the entire `Land/Element/Output` build configuration tree to align indentation and brace style with project standards, ensuring consistent formatting across `ESBuild` configurations, `Plugin` definitions, and `Polyfill` scripts.\n\nSimultaneously, enhance the `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnosticsInner` transform to inject deeper runtime diagnostics into extension webviews. Add a `MutationObserver` to track DOM mutations and snapshot body state, plus comprehensive hooks for `ReactDOM` (`createRoot`, `render`) to capture React lifecycle errors, container details, and window React key dumps. This enables granular diagnosis of webview bootstrapping failures and silent render crashes under the WKWebView/Tauri runtime.\n\nThe generated `Configuration` artifacts are updated to reflect the source changes and ensure the build pipeline remains consistent.\n\nImpact: Standardizes codebase formatting and provides critical observability for debugging extension webview integration issues.",
			"SHA": "7409c08d3ee8559e37d240eaa4976173f8578449"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-14T18:38:12Z",
			"File": [
				"⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				738,
				117
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Expand webview inner-iframe diagnostics for React debugging\n\nEnhance the `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnosticsInner` transform plugin to inject advanced React-specific tracing into the extension webview's inner iframe context. The transformation now includes:\n\n- **React DOM Hooks:** Intercept `ReactDOM.createRoot` and `ReactDOM.render` to log every component mount, update, and error lifecycle event, capturing container IDs and element types.\n- **DOM Mutation Observers:** Install a mutation observer on the document body to track Shadow DOM host insertions and snapshot HTML snippets to diagnose dynamic DOM restructuring.\n- **Environment Snapshots:** Dumps window React-related keys and initial DOM state to aid in diagnosing module loading failures.\n\nAdditionally, update the build pipeline configuration in `Configuration/Plugin/Index.js` and regenerate compiled artifacts (ESBuild configurations, Transform plugins, and Polyfills) to ensure these diagnostic hooks are active. This enhancement follows the previous commit's webview diagnostics work and targets silent hangs or render failures in React-based extension UIs.",
			"SHA": "7bf3a06e1c95630270d3fe1e4d35fe551172f146"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
